Ada apa dengan ketawa jahat itu?

1735
01:15:47.960 --> 01:15:49.294
{\an8}<i>Cik. Seorang Penari

1736
01:15:50.671 --> 01:15:51.755
{\an8}<i>Adakah anda</i>

1737
01:15:52.965 --> 01:15:55.634
{\an8}<i>Pembunuh Lee Gun-jun?</i>

1738
01:16:04.309 --> 01:16:05.561
{\an8}<i>Ya, dia!</i>

1739
01:16:07.145 --> 01:16:08.438
{\an8}<i>Ya, dia!</i>

1740
